{"title":"Socket","uid":"f1176c7b24a04d98c4070e6d4bd0d70f","slug":"网络/Socket","date":"2025-02-09T17:43:22.000Z","updated":"2025-03-31T09:53:04.796Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/网络/Socket.json","keywords":null,"cover":"../../images/network/img.png","content":"<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/455352339\">聊聊Netty那些事儿之从内核角度看IO模型</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"Socket-数据接收到-Epoll-处理流程\"><a href=\"#Socket-数据接收到-Epoll-处理流程\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Socket 数据接收到 Epoll 处理流程\"></a>Socket 数据接收到 Epoll 处理流程</h3><p><img src=\"/../../images/network/img.png\" alt=\"img\"></p>\n<figure class=\"shiki\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre class=\"shiki material-theme-palenight\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">sequenceDiagram</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">participant S as Socket</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">participant WQ as Wait Queue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">participant CB as Callback (ep_poll_callback)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">participant EP as eppoll_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">participant EI as epitem</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">participant EPL as eventpoll</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    S-&gt;&gt;S: 接收数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    S-&gt;&gt;WQ: 触发等待队列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    WQ-&gt;&gt;CB: 调用回调函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    CB-&gt;&gt;EP: container_of 找到 eppoll_entry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    EP-&gt;&gt;EI: 访问 base 指针找到 epitem</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color: #babed8\">    EI-&gt;&gt;EPL: 将 epitem 加入活跃队列</span></span></code></pre></div></div></figure>\n\n<ol>\n<li><p>数据到达和初始处理：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>网卡接收数据，通过 DMA 将数据放入 Ring Buffer。</li>\n<li>触发软中断，内核将数据包（sk_buff）放入 socket 的接收队列。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>Socket 唤醒等待队列：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Socket 检测到有新数据，开始唤醒其等待队列（wait_queue）中的等待者。</li>\n<li>获取其中一个 wait_queue_entry_t，这里不获取全部一是避免惊群效应，二是 epoll 场景下一般也只会有一个 wait_queue_entry_t</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>回调函数触发：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>对于 epoll 添加的等待项，其 wait_queue_entry_t 的回调函数是 ep_poll_callback。</li>\n<li>内核调用这个回调函数，传入 wait_queue_entry_t 指针作为参数。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><p>找到 eppoll_entry：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在 ep_poll_callback 函数中，使用 container_of 宏。</li>\n<li>通过 wait_queue_entry_t 指针，找到包含它的 eppoll_entry 结构。</li>\n</ul>\n <figure class=\"shiki C\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>struct eppoll_entry *pwq = container_of(wait, struct eppoll_entry, wait);</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p>从 eppoll_entry 到 epitem：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>eppoll_entry 结构中有一个 base 指针，直接指向关联的 epitem。</li>\n</ul>\n <figure class=\"shiki C\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>struct epitem *epi = pwq->base;</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p>获取 eventpoll 结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>epitem 结构中包含指向其关联的 eventpoll 结构的指针。</li>\n</ul>\n <figure class=\"shiki C\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>struct eventpoll *ep = epi->ep;</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p>将 epitem 加入活跃队列：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>检查 epitem 是否已经在活跃队列中。</li>\n<li>如果不在，则将其添加到 eventpoll 的活跃队列（rdllist）中。</li>\n</ul>\n <figure class=\"shiki C\"><div class='codeblock'><div class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></div><div class=\"code\"><pre><code>if (!ep_is_linked(&epi->rdllink))\n    list_add_tail(&epi->rdllink, &ep->rdllist);</code></pre></div></div></figure>\n</li>\n<li><p>唤醒等待的进程：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果有进程正在等待 epoll 事件（通过 epoll_wait），唤醒它。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n","text":" 聊聊Netty那些事儿之从内核角度看IO模型 Socket 数据接收到 Epoll 处理流程 1234567891011121314sequenceDiagr...","permalink":"/post/网络/Socket","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"1.4k","symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"网络","slug":"网络","count":5,"path":"api/categories/网络.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"linux","slug":"linux","count":5,"path":"api/tags/linux.json"},{"name":"网络","slug":"网络","count":5,"path":"api/tags/网络.json"},{"name":"socket","slug":"socket","count":3,"path":"api/tags/socket.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#Socket-%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E5%88%B0-Epoll-%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B\"><span class=\"toc-text\">Socket 数据接收到 Epoll 处理流程</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"WU LEI","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"/images/avatar.jpg","link":"/","description":"Code & Life <br> 道阻且长，行则将至","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/taeyang0126","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"TCP 连接","uid":"46e6e8b444a664daf9c1741fe77e4e4c","slug":"网络/TCP 连接","date":"2025-02-09T17:45:22.000Z","updated":"2025-03-31T09:53:04.797Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/网络/TCP 连接.json","keywords":null,"cover":